   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "添加盒子和插件，打造大储物方案",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "s19197445"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/03/94/0394b0dee746f067ab337c7a344a354d.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/03/94/0394b0dee746f067ab337c7a344a354d.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>4.在客厅打造定制储物方案</strong>&nbsp;添加拉出式储物盒与插件，让大储物单元更为实用。混搭开放式和封闭式储物装置，挑选不同的材质打造个性十足的外观。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
