   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "把衣服存放在贴有标签的盒子里",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "50263635"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/ba/44/ba446c54244fec371791138a95585e8f.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/ba/44/ba446c54244fec371791138a95585e8f.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>5.将盒子叠放在卧室里&nbsp;</strong>把过季的衣服装进盒子里，然后在盒子外贴上标签，便能清楚地知道里面装了什么。Mercedes没有把衣服挂在一贯使用的衣柜里，而是放在挂衣杆和储物盒里，然后用挂帘遮蔽了起来。&ldquo;我只需更换布料，就能让房间焕然一新。&rdquo;</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "帮助孩子寻找灵感",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "80354276"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/c9/84/c984bf1cae84587a919486ab27c53596.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/c9/84/c984bf1cae84587a919486ab27c53596.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>6.激发创造力</strong>&nbsp;让孩子轻松在卧室中轻松获取灵感。Mercedes在女儿Emília（6岁）的书桌上摆放了搁板和储物盒，用来存放五颜六色的美术用品和玩具。每隔几周她就会挑选一幅新画作挂在墙壁上，Mercedes会帮忙用纸胶带贴上。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "Mercedes和Emília的照片",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
